			alt="The Tera Mini wireless barcode scanner used to scan the toy food"
			class="mx-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full"
		/>
		<figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic">
			The Tera Mini QR code scanner, connected in Bluetooth keyboard-wedge mode.
		</figcaption>
	</figure>
	<figure class="text-center">
